{"thread":{"threadID":4540,"boardID":117,"topic":"Changelog - 16.06.2017 (Jail, MG, SurfSki, TTT)","time":1497569786,"userID":1825,"username":"Nachtfrische","lastPostTime":1497632924,"lastPoster":"Skittles","replies":20,"views":883,"attachments":0,"isSticky":0,"isClosed":0,"cumulativeLikes":8},"tags":[{"tagID":1121,"name":"best"},{"tagID":210,"name":"changelog"},{"tagID":281,"name":"Community"},{"tagID":207,"name":"csgo"},{"tagID":984,"name":"deutsch"},{"tagID":28,"name":"jail"},{"tagID":89,"name":"maps"},{"tagID":106,"name":"mg"},{"tagID":160,"name":"Minigame"},{"tagID":996,"name":"surfski"},{"tagID":597,"name":"Teamspeak"},{"tagID":208,"name":"ttt"}],"posts":[{"postID":67325,"threadID":4540,"userID":1825,"username":"Nachtfrische","subject":"Changelog - 16.06.2017 (Jail, MG, SurfSki, TTT)","time":1497569786,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":"","attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":8,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":2101,"username":"Hypnoxas","time":1497571890,"value":1},{"userID":2369,"username":"Luckiris","time":1497592453,"value":1},{"userID":1998,"username":"aXaX.","time":1497598977,"value":1},{"userID":1888,"username":"Kenny","time":1497606526,"value":1},{"userID":2404,"username":"Mas0n","time":1497610671,"value":1},{"userID":2375,"username":"<<<","time":1497623897,"value":1},{"userID":2335,"username":"Thorin Pikachu","time":1497643629,"value":1},{"userID":2356,"username":"DerXXLMario","time":1497709499,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<div class=\"message-align\"><p><span class=\"missing-media\">[Bild]</span></p></div><p><br><strong>--- Jail Server ---</strong><br>- Das Gang-Plugin hat ein Update erhalten, welches verschiedene Fehler behebt.<br>- Es wurde ein Plugin hinzugefügt, welches euren Gangnamen auf dem Scoreboard vor eurem Namen als Clantag anzeigt. Dies sieht wie folgt aus:</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><span class=\"missing-media\">[Bild]</span></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>- Folgende Maps wurden dem Server hinzugefügt (danke an <a href=\"http://dream-community.de/index.php?user/2106-ifz4ne/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@ifZ4ne</a> für den Vorschlag):<br></p>\n<ul>\n<li>ba_cg_jb_minecraft_tbs_2016</li>\n<li>ba_cg_tankdepot_v3</li>\n<li>\nba_jail_canyondam_go wurde durch ba_jail_canyondam_v2b ersetzt</li>\n<li>\njb_lego_jail_v8_fixed wurde durch jb_lego_jail_v11 ersetzt</li>\n<li>jb_moti</li>\n<li>\njb_spy_vs_spy_xmas wurde durch  jb_spy_vs_spy_beta7 ersetzt</li>\n<li>\njb_tropical_island_v2 wurde durch jb_tropical_island_v4_passover ersetzt</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>--- Minigame Server ---</strong><br>- Folgende Maps wurden dem Server hinzugefügt (danke an <a href=\"http://dream-community.de/index.php?user/2375/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@&lt;&lt;&lt;</a> für den Vorschlag):<br></p>\n<ul>\n<li>mg_azure</li>\n<li>mg_escape_castle_v2</li>\n<li>mg_four_towers_course_v1_8</li>\n<li>mg_mars_course_fix</li>\n<li>mg_sodan_lab_tp_csgo</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>--- SurfSki Server ---</strong><br>- Ein Plugin, welches verschiedene Informationen für Zuschauer, wie z.B. Geschwindigkeit, anzeigt, wurde hinzugefügt. Danke an <a href=\"http://dream-community.de/index.php?user/2338-exo/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@[eXo]</a> für das Plugin.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><span class=\"missing-media\">[Bild]</span></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><strong>--- TTT Server ---</strong><br>- Folgende Maps wurden dem Server hinzugefügt (danke an <a href=\"http://dream-community.de/index.php?user/2106-ifz4ne/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@ifZ4ne</a>  und <a href=\"http://dream-community.de/index.php?user/2237-gaara/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@Gaara</a> für den Vorschlag):<br></p>\n<ul>\n<li>ttt_afterglow_v1 </li>\n<li>ttt_cg_magma_v2b </li>\n<li>ttt_codewise2_v3_1 </li>\n<li>\nttt_community_pool_csgoport_v6 wurde durch ttt_community_pool_2017_v1 ersetzt</li>\n<li>ttt_craftroom_csgo_v2 </li>\n<li>ttt_druglab_v3_2 </li>\n<li>ttt_haunts_sg </li>\n<li>ttt_minecraft_cg13 </li>\n<li>ttt_murdertown_a2 </li>\n<li>ttt_parkhousefix </li>\n<li>ttt_salazar_castle </li>\n<li>ttt_terminal_sg_v1 </li>\n<li>ttt_vo_sg </li>\n</ul>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Wir wünschen euch viel Spaß auf den Servern und freuen uns auf weitere Vorschläge!</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":67329,"threadID":4540,"userID":2526,"username":"Burn","subject":"","time":1497607278,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":"","attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":1,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":2556,"username":"kRAYZN","time":1497608129,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>Finde das Update mit den Clan-Tags geil!<br>Leider wird man oben in dem Scoreboard immer die &quot;31erMois&quot; Gang sehen..</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":67332,"threadID":4540,"userID":2556,"username":"kRAYZN","subject":"","time":1497608110,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":"","attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":2,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":2526,"username":"Burn","time":1497608793,"value":1},{"userID":2404,"username":"Mas0n","time":1497612940,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>Find das mit dem Clantag auch echt Nice! ;P</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Good Work :)!</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":67333,"threadID":4540,"userID":2576,"username":"TimeShot","subject":"","time":1497608340,"lastEditTime":1497628069,"editCount":1,"editReason":"","attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":1,"editorID":2576,"editor":"TimeShot","likes":[{"userID":2526,"username":"Burn","time":1497608795,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p><a href=\"http://dream-community.de/index.php?user/2526-brennen/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@brennen</a> guter Witz <span class=\"archive-emoji\">🙂</span></p>","polls":[]},{"postID":67334,"threadID":4540,"userID":1173,"username":"Nightlight","subject":"","time":1497608546,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":4,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":2526,"userna